Indicator Name: Absolute RSI Momentum Strength

This indicator calculates the absolute deviation of the Relative Strength Index (RSI) from its neutral midpoint of 50. It quantifies the overall strength of momentum (either bullish or bearish) in an asset. A higher score indicates stronger conviction in the current price trend, making it an excellent complement to NATR by filtering for assets with stable, robust momentum, which are more likely to exhibit successful channel breakouts.
