Indicator Name: Normalized MACD-OBV Trend Intensity (MVTI)

This indicator provides a holistic view of an asset's trend quality by combining the strength of momentum (via the absolute MACD Histogram) with the consistency of volume flow (via the absolute On-Balance Volume Rate of Change). By normalizing both components and averaging them, MVTI identifies assets exhibiting clear, strong momentum supported by sustained buying or selling pressure, making them ideal candidates for the channel breakout strategy to succeed and sustain its trend.
