Indicator Name: Coppock Curve
The Coppock Curve measures the long-term momentum's persistence and quality. While NATR ensures sufficient volatility, a high absolute Coppock value indicates strong, stable, and persistent momentum (either upward or downward). This stability enhances the probability that a volume-confirmed channel breakout will lead to a sustained move rather than a whipsaw, thus identifying environments where the strategy's core logic is more likely to succeed.
