Indicator Name: Trend-Aligned Money Flow Score (TAMFS)

This indicator leverages the Money Flow Index (MFI) to assess the quality of price movement based on sustained volume. It complements NATR by focusing on the directional conviction and efficiency of money flow within an existing trend. A high score indicates that the MFI strongly confirms the prevailing SMA trend (high MFI in uptrends, low MFI in downtrends), suggesting a robust, volume-backed environment where the strategy's channel breakouts are more likely to succeed.
