Indicator Name: Trend-Aligned PPO Strength (TAPS)

This indicator complements NATR by focusing on the quality and conviction of an asset's trend and momentum, rather than just raw volatility. It measures how strongly the Percentage Price Oscillator (PPO) momentum aligns with the strategy's dual-SMA trend direction, providing a higher score for assets exhibiting clear, sustained momentum in the direction of their prevailing trend, which is ideal for confirming and capitalizing on channel breakouts.
