Indicator Name: Absolute Ease of Movement (AEMV)

This indicator complements NATR by assessing the "efficiency" of price movement relative to volume. While NATR confirms sufficient volatility, AEMV helps identify assets where prices are moving freely and easily (high AEMV) versus those experiencing choppy, high-friction, or inefficient movement despite volatility. This is crucial for a breakout strategy that relies on sustained momentum after volume-confirmed breakouts, favoring environments where price trends cleanly.
