Indicator Name: Absolute Aroon Oscillator (AAO)
The Absolute Aroon Oscillator (AAO) assesses trend strength and consistency by measuring how recently new highs and lows occurred. It complements NATR by focusing on the *quality* and *stability* of price movement, distinguishing strong, sustained trends (ideal for channel breakouts) from mere volatility or choppiness.
