Indicator Name: Trend-Aligned OBV Momentum

This indicator complements NATR by providing a volumetric measure of trend quality and stability. While NATR ensures sufficient volatility for price movement, Trend-Aligned OBV Momentum acts as a quality filter, ensuring that any price movements and breakouts are consistently backed by strong, directional volume flow. For the strategy to succeed, breakouts need not just elevated volume *at the point of breakout*, but also a sustained underlying volume pressure in the direction of the trend, indicating conviction and robustness. This indicator quantifies that sustained, aligned volume conviction, making the selected assets more likely to have successful breakouts and follow-through.
