This indicator measures the rolling correlation between price changes and volume changes. A high positive score indicates that price increases are consistently accompanied by rising volume, and price decreases by falling volume. This complements NATR (which ensures sufficient volatility) by identifying assets where price movements are genuinely supported and confirmed by trading activity, suggesting higher quality, more robust trends suitable for momentum breakouts.
