Indicator Name: **VWMA Trend Strength (VTS)**

The VWMA Trend Strength (VTS) indicator quantifies the conviction and momentum behind the prevailing price trend by measuring the absolute Rate of Change of a Volume-Weighted Moving Average. Since NATR already filters for sufficient volatility, VTS complements this by focusing on how strongly price is moving with significant volume backing, indicating a robust and high-quality trend. A higher VTS value suggests a more reliable and volume-backed trend, signaling greater potential for the strategy's channel breakouts to achieve follow-through and confirming the efficacy of its dual SMA trend filter.
