--------------------
Indicator Name: RVI Trend Persistence Score
This indicator leverages the Relative Vigor Index (RVI) to assess the **quality and persistence of a trend's internal momentum**. While NATR filters for sufficient volatility, the RVI Trend Persistence Score evaluates how consistently price closes near its high or low relative to its open, indicative of efficient directional pressure. A high score suggests a strong, clean trend with robust bar-level conviction, making the environment favorable for momentum breakouts to succeed and reducing the likelihood of false signals.
==================================================


