Indicator Name: Normalized Linear Regression Trend Strength (NLRTS)
This indicator complements NATR by providing a measure of the consistency and strength of a price trend, regardless of its direction. While NATR ensures sufficient volatility in an asset, NLRTS identifies markets with clear, persistent trending behavior, which are ideal for a channel momentum strategy that relies on sustained breakouts and SMA trend confirmation. A high NLRTS score signifies a robust trend environment, increasing the probability of successful entries and follow-through.
