This indicator complements NATR by assessing the "quality" or "conviction" of the prevailing trend, which is crucial for a channel momentum strategy looking for sustained moves. It evaluates how well the internal candlestick vigor (Relative Vigor Index, RVI) aligns with the overall trend direction defined by the strategy's own dual Simple Moving Averages, providing a score that is high when momentum and trend are strongly synchronized.
