Indicator Name: Smoothed Absolute Rate of Change (SARC)
This indicator measures the absolute magnitude of price momentum over a defined period, then applies an Exponential Moving Average (EMA) to reduce noise and provide a stable measure of trend strength. A high SARC value indicates persistent and robust price movement, regardless of direction, suggesting a high-quality trend where the strategy's volume-filtered channel breakouts are more likely to succeed. It complements NATR by focusing on the directional conviction and stability of price movement rather than just its general volatility.
