This indicator quantifies the strength and conviction of price movement within each bar, specifically favoring the direction of the prevailing trend as defined by the dual SMAs. A high TACS value indicates that closing prices are consistently near the highs during an uptrend or near the lows during a downtrend, signaling strong directional commitment and stable momentum. It complements NATR by focusing on the quality of price action and trend consistency rather than raw volatility.
==================================================


