Indicator Name: Absolute Volume-Price Correlation (AVPC)

This indicator complements NATR by assessing the *conviction and efficiency* of price movements relative to trading volume. While NATR ensures sufficient volatility, AVPC quantifies the strength of the statistical relationship between price changes and volume, ensuring that price moves (especially breakouts) are robustly supported by participant activity, indicating higher quality trends and more reliable momentum.
