This indicator complements NATR by assessing the *quality* and *conviction* of the prevailing trend rather than just its volatility. It quantifies how consistently price closes near its extreme in the direction of the SMA-filtered trend, reinforced by above-average trading volume, thereby identifying assets with strong, well-supported directional momentum ideal for channel breakouts.
