Indicator Name: Elder Ray Trend Momentum (ERTM)
This indicator measures the strength and conviction of the current trend, as defined by the strategy's dual SMAs, using Elder Ray's Bull and Bear Power concepts. A high ERTM score signifies that the price's extremes (highs/lows) are aggressively extending in the direction of the established trend, indicating strong underlying momentum and "Trend Quality" or "Momentum Stability" that complements NATR by focusing on directional strength rather than just volatility.
