🤖 AI의 지표 선정 이유 (Directional Momentum Strength (DMS)):
--------------------
Indicator Name: Directional Momentum Strength (DMS)
The Directional Momentum Strength (DMS) indicator quantifies the net directional force of price movement, offering a direct measure of trend quality and momentum stability. It leverages Wilder's well-known Directional Movement Index components (+DI and -DI) by calculating their difference as a single, signed value. A high positive DMS indicates a strong, sustained upward directional momentum, suggesting a robust uptrend that is conducive to long breakouts with follow-through. Conversely, a strong negative DMS signals a powerful downtrend, making it suitable for short breakouts. This metric directly complements NATR (which ensures sufficient volatility) by focusing on the *quality* and *persistence* of the prevailing trend, thereby providing a superior environment for the channel momentum strategy.
==================================================


