Indicator Name: Median Price Momentum Flow (MPMF)
This indicator measures the short-term momentum of the median price relative to its longer-term momentum, effectively quantifying the intensity and direction of buying or selling pressure. It is then explicitly aligned with the prevailing trend identified by the strategy's dual SMA filter. A higher positive MPMF value signifies stronger, more aligned momentum with the current trend, indicating a high-conviction environment for breakouts and complementing NATR by focusing on trend robustness rather than just volatility.
