🤖 AI의 지표 선정 이유 (SMA Divergence Rate):
--------------------
Indicator Name: SMA Divergence Rate

This indicator measures the rate at which the fast and slow Simple Moving Averages (SMAs) are diverging or converging. For a trend-following breakout strategy, a high positive "SMA Divergence Rate" indicates an *accelerating trend* (fast SMA pulling away from slow SMA), signaling increasing momentum and conviction which makes breakouts more likely to be sustained. This complements NATR (which ensures sufficient volatility) by focusing on the quality and acceleration of the underlying trend, reducing whipsaws and improving the success rate of channel breakouts.
