Indicator Name: Smoothed Volume Price Trend Slope (SVPT_Slope)
This indicator measures the rate of change of the volume-weighted price trend, effectively quantifying the acceleration or deceleration of buying/selling pressure. It complements NATR (which ensures sufficient volatility) by focusing on the underlying conviction of price movements, indicating how consistently volume supports the current trend. A high absolute value suggests a strong, well-supported directional move, making breakouts more likely to be sustained and profitable.
