Indicator Name: Absolute Smoothed OBV Rate of Change (ASO-ROC)
This indicator measures the absolute rate of change of a smoothed On-Balance Volume (OBV). A high ASO-ROC value indicates strong, persistent volume-driven momentum in either direction, signaling that buying or selling pressure is efficiently and consistently accumulating. It complements NATR by filtering for high-conviction trends, where price movements are significantly backed by sustained volume flow, making the strategy's channel breakouts more reliable and likely to sustain.
