Indicator Name: Normalized Price Volume Trend Rate of Change (NPVT_ROC)

This indicator measures the acceleration of the volume-weighted price trend, providing insight into the conviction and efficiency of directional price movement. NATR already ensures sufficient volatility, so NPVT_ROC complements this by identifying assets where strong price momentum is consistently backed by significant trading volume, leading to a more reliable and sustained trend. A high NPVT_ROC suggests that the price is moving with increasing strength, supported by active market participation, which increases the probability of successful channel breakouts and trend continuation for the given strategy.
