Indicator Name: Absolute Fisher Transform
This indicator complements NATR by identifying markets with strong, committed trends, rather than just general volatility. A high absolute Fisher Transform value indicates that price is at an extreme relative to its recent range, which is ideal for the channel momentum strategy to capture robust breakouts within a well-defined trend, reducing false signals in choppy or weakly trending conditions.
