Indicator Name: Smoothed Absolute Balance of Power (SABOP)
SABOP measures the conviction of buying or selling pressure within each price bar, smoothed over a period. A high SABOP value indicates that prices are consistently closing near their highs during uptrends or near their lows during downtrends, signaling strong, stable momentum and high trend quality. This complements NATR by filtering for assets where underlying price action shows clear directional control, leading to more reliable breakouts and sustained trends, which are crucial for the Volume-Filtered Channel Momentum strategy to succeed.
